 others, we're waiting to see how their careers will turn out.","published":"2023-11-15T14:55:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Raylen Wilson, No. 57 football recruit in ESPN Junior 300, commits to Michigan Wolverines","description":"Linebacker Raylen Wilson, the No. 57-ranked recruit in the ESPN Junior 300 out of Tallahassee (Florida) Lincoln, has committed to Michigan over Georgia.","published":"2024-01-23T15:55:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/recruiting/football/story/_/id/32823300/raylen-wilson-no-57-football-recruit-espn-junior-300-commits-michigan-wolverines","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman race for Week 12: Wake Forest's Gio Lopez makes late push","description":"Much like his team, the Demon Deacons' QB has slipped under the radar much of the season -- but no more.","published":"2026-11-24T11:31:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50573849/heisman-race-wake-forest-gio-lopez","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tiering the CFP favorites: Who's actually built to win on top of the odds board","description":"CFP futures got murkier after Saturday's results. But which teams can actually go far in the tournament?","published":"2026-11-24T12:03:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50573806/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-futures-odds-picks","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble before committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-24T11:29:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What qualities make the perfect coach? We're borrowing from the best","description":"If we can build a coach in a lab, we can start with these qualities and skills.","published":"2026-11-24T11:23:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50476785/building-perfect-coach","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC to consider termination of LSU's membership at Dec. 3 meeting","description":"For the second time this year, the SEC is threatening to hold a vote of its chancellors and presidents on whether to kick LSU out of the league, according to a filing in federal court in Alabama on Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T12:52:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50577602/sec-consider-termination-lsu-membership","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia defensive coordinator Glenn Schumann agrees to coach Florida State","description":"Georgia's Glenn Schumann, one of the country's top defensive coordinators and part of a staff that has the Bulldogs at No. 1 in the CFP rankings, agreed to a five-year deal to become the next coach at Florida State, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T02:51:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577665/uga-defensive-coordinator-schumann-coach-florida-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Aiden Flora, nation's leading rusher, re-signs with Iowa State for next season","description":"Iowa State running back Aiden Flora, who leads the nation in rushing, announced Monday that he has re-signed with the Cyclones for next season.","published":"2026-11-23T23:57:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577520/aiden-flora-nation-leading-rusher-re-signs-iowa-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas A&M names John Thornton interim athletic director effective Dec. 1","description":"John Thornton will take over as interim athletic director at Texas A&M, effective Dec. 1, replacing the departed Trev Alberts.","published":"2026-11-23T22:07:34.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50576559/texas-names-john-thornton-interim-ad-effective-dec-1","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4871074/raylen-wilson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Raylen Wilson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raylen_Wilson","description":"American football player (born 2005)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Raylen Akin Wilson (born July 7, 2005) is an American college football linebacker for the Georgia Bulldogs of the Southeastern Conference (SEC).","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Wilson attended Lincoln High School in Tallahassee, Florida. As a senior, he had 117 tackles and as a senior and junior, he was the Tallahassee Democrat All-Big Bend Defensive Player of the Year. A five-star recruit, Wilson was selected to play in the 2023 Under Armour All-America Game. He originally committed to the University of Michigan to play college football but switched to the University of Georgia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a true freshman at Georgia in 2023, Wilson played in 12 games with one start and had 15 tackles and 0.5 sacks. He returned to Georgia for his sophomore year in 2024."}],"family":[{"relation":"Father","name":"Robert Wilson","description":"American footballer, born 1974","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Wilson_(wide_receiver)"}]}}